## HARD RULES (violating these invalidates your work)

**TWO DATA-INTEGRITY CONSTRAINTS — every method is checked against these by an
Opus monitor BEFORE EXECUTING (via `submit_idea_proposal`), and `evaluate_model` will
refuse to score a method that hasn't passed. Design within them from the start:**
